#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0205-A expect=violation domain=TF
#note "PLAN-send-tfdetect-pathology-unpark: Row 1 (001, M1) is a PM palpable mass and in no CL or MA record (PM is its ONLY link) -> detected in life, CDISC-SEND-0203's case, NOT judged here though TFDETECT 50 is wrong, and the silence is owed to the PM test alone (review M1: row 1 was MA-linked too, so the MA test silenced it and the PM test was untested). Row 2 (002, M2) is linked to no CL, PM or MA record -> REPORTED. Near-misses: PM holds M2 for subject 001, which must not link subject 002's M2 (the link is per subject); subject 003 IS in PM, but under another PMSPID (M8), so its M3 is not PM-linked and is still judged -> REPORTED (the link is per mass, not per subject; review L1). Red-before (review fix, TF-2): with the 'not in $pm_masses' term deleted, row 1 fired (3 findings, expected 2); with the PM link read per subject only (USUBJID not in a PM subject set) row 3 went silent (fired 1, expected 2). When first written (TF-1) the rule was parked (Executability Not Executable), so the scenario failed with the rule not a member of the sendig 3.1.1 package. ⚑ PLAN-join-key-one-side-absent-drop QK17 (owner 2026-10-11): split by the pool gate — a study that defines no pools is judged by CDISC-SEND-0205-A (moved from CDISC-SEND-0205, same expectation)"
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=2 TFSPID=M2
#expectViolationAt row=3 TFSPID=M3
dataset TF class=FINDINGS label="Tumor Findings"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col TFSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TFSPID   type=Char label="Sponsor-Defined Identifier"
col TFTESTCD type=Char label="Tumor Findings Test Short Name"
col TFDETECT type=Num  label="Time in Days to Detection of Tumor"
---
S1 | TF | 001 | 1 | M1 | TUMEXAM | 50
S1 | TF | 002 | 2 | M2 | TUMEXAM | 50
S1 | TF | 003 | 3 | M3 | TUMEXAM | 50
---
dataset DS class=EVENTS label="Disposition"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col DSSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DSTERM  type=Char label="Reported Term for the Disposition Event"
col DSDECOD type=Char label="Standardized Disposition Term"
col DSSTDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of Disposition"
---
S1 | DS | 001 | 1 | TERMINAL SACRIFICE | TERMINAL SACRIFICE | 2020-04-09
S1 | DS | 002 | 1 | TERMINAL SACRIFICE | TERMINAL SACRIFICE | 2020-04-09
S1 | DS | 003 | 1 | TERMINAL SACRIFICE | TERMINAL SACRIFICE | 2020-04-09
---
dataset EX class=INTERVENTIONS label="Exposure"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col EXSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col EXTRT   type=Char label="Name of Treatment"
col EXSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Treatment"
---
S1 | EX | 001 | 1 | DRUG A | 2020-01-01
S1 | EX | 002 | 2 | DRUG A | 2020-01-01
S1 | EX | 003 | 3 | DRUG A | 2020-01-01
---
dataset MA class=FINDINGS label="Macroscopic Findings"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col MASEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col MASPID   type=Char label="Sponsor-Defined Identifier"
col MATESTCD type=Char label="Macroscopic Examination Short Name"
col MAORRES  type=Char label="Result or Finding in Original Units"
---
S1 | MA | 001 | 1 | M9 | GROSPATH | MASS
S1 | MA | 002 | 2 | M9 | GROSPATH | MASS
---
dataset PM class=FINDINGS label="Palpable Masses"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PMSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col PMSPID   type=Char label="Sponsor-Defined Identifier"
col PMTESTCD type=Char label="Palpable Mass Test Short Name"
col PMORRES  type=Char label="Result or Finding in Original Units"
col PMDTC    type=Char label="Date/Time of Observation"
---
S1 | PM | 001 | 1 | M1 | LENGTH | 10 | 2020-02-19
S1 | PM | 001 | 2 | M2 | LENGTH | 10 | 2020-02-19
S1 | PM | 003 | 3 | M8 | LENGTH | 10 | 2020-02-19
---
